# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# PRIVATE FINANCIAL DATA MUST NEVER BE COMMITTED (see PROJECT_PRINCIPLES.md).
# Statements, backups and exports are ignored everywhere. The only PDFs allowed
# in the repository are synthetic fixtures under tests/fixtures/synthetic/,
# and scripts/check-repo-hygiene.mjs enforces this in CI.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
